Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:51.85,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:56.19,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}胸が{\c&HA000FF&}沈{\c&FFFFFF&}んで未{\c&HA000FF&}来{\c&FFFFFF&}感じれなくなったり
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:01:01.19,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}時が{\c&HA000FF&}止{\c&FFFFFF&}まってもう終わったって{\c&HA000FF&}感{\c&FFFFFF&}じたり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:07.69,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}塞ぎ{\c&HA000FF&}込{\c&FFFFFF&}んで　{\c&HA000FF&}話{\c&FFFFFF&}せなくて　じわり心の傘{\c&HA000FF&}が{\c&FFFFFF&}開いた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:11.31,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}それでも{\c&HA000FF&}強{\c&FFFFFF&}がって生きてた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:15.77,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}慰{\c&FFFFFF&}めてなんて言わない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:20.81,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}強く{\c&HA000FF&}な{\c&FFFFFF&}って前を見て{\c&HA000FF&}た{\c&FFFFFF&}いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:27.35,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}だけど弱さが{\c&HA000FF&}押{\c&FFFFFF&}しつぶす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:33.81,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}君{\c&HA000FF&}に{\c&FFFFFF&}会って世{\c&HA000FF&}界{\c&FFFFFF&}溢れて光与えてく{\c&HA000FF&}れ{\c&FFFFFF&}たり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:38.56,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}少しだって{\c&HA000FF&}希{\c&FFFFFF&}望なかった僕が{\c&HA000FF&}笑{\c&FFFFFF&}えてたん{\c&HA000FF&}だ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:43.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}何気ない{\c&HA000FF&}会{\c&FFFFFF&}話でずっと笑{\c&HA000FF&}顔{\c&FFFFFF&}与えてくれたり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:47.19,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}ありがとう{\c&HA000FF&}っ{\c&FFFFFF&}て照れて笑{\c&HA000FF&}う{\c&FFFFFF&}から言わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:48.81,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}だけど{\c&HA000FF&}思{\c&FFFFFF&}ってるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:52.60,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}この先{\c&HA000FF&}前{\c&FFFFFF&}向いていけ{\c&HA000FF&}る{\c&FFFFFF&}かな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}光{\c&HFFFFFF&}よ　僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:51.85,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:56.19,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}胸口{\c&HA000FF&}沉{\c&FFFFFF&}重  我看不到{\c&HA000FF&}未{\c&FFFFFF&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:01:01.19,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}时{\c&FFFFFF&}间停滞  感觉一{\c&HA000FF&}切{\c&FFFFFF&}都尘埃落定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:07.69,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}封{\c&HA000FF&}锁{\c&FFFFFF&}自我  无人倾{\c&HA000FF&}诉{\c&FFFFFF&}  渐渐撑开{\c&HA000FF&}心{\c&FFFFFF&}的防护伞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:11.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}却仍硬撑着{\c&HA000FF&}活{\c&FFFFFF&}下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:15.77,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}不需要{\c&HA000FF&}安{\c&FFFFFF&}慰的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:20.81,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}只想要{\c&HA000FF&}变{\c&FFFFFF&}强  一直向前{\c&HA000FF&}看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:27.35,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}然而软{\c&HA000FF&}弱{\c&FFFFFF&}却快将我压垮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:33.81,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}与你{\c&HA000FF&}的{\c&FFFFFF&}相会让我的世界{\c&HA000FF&}充{\c&FFFFFF&}满光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:38.56,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}万{\c&HA000FF&}念{\c&FFFFFF&}俱灰的我也能稍微{\c&HA000FF&}露{\c&FFFFFF&}出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:43.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}即使是{\c&HA000FF&}平{\c&FFFFFF&}常的对话{\c&HA000FF&}仍{\c&FFFFFF&}让我微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:47.19,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}不会道{\c&HA000FF&}谢{\c&FFFFFF&}  因为我会害羞想{\c&HA000FF&}笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:48.81,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}但我会时刻{\c&HA000FF&}思{\c&FFFFFF&}考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:52.60,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}今{\c&HA000FF&}后{\c&FFFFFF&}我能否继{\c&HA000FF&}续{\c&FFFFFF&}大步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}光啊  照耀{\c&HA000FF&}我{\c&FFFFFF&}吧
